<h1>My Objects</h1>
<p>take one of your 5 Books in Excel books and create a BoxLang structure out of it's metadata. 
    Use multiple structures to model as much of the metadata as you can including data from all four Excel Sheets 
    (or SQL Tables). When you are done, dump out each of the objects you created.</p>


<p><strong>Answer</strong>: the myBook structure contains 6 structures: basicInfo, categoryInfo, 
    authorInfo, publicationInfo, and physicalInfo. The structures contain the metadata 
    about the books in the form of key/value pairs.</p>

    <!--- https://boxlang.ortusbooks.com/boxlang-language/syntax/structures --->

<bx:set myBook={
    basicInfo: {
        title:"All Systems Red",
        copyrightYear:"2017",
        price:19.99
    },
    categoryInfo: {
        category: "Fiction",
        genre: "Science Fiction"
    },
    authorInfo: {
        authorFirstName:"Martha",
        authorLastName:"Wells"
    },
    publicationInfo: {  
        ISBN13:"978-1-250-21471-3",
        language:"English",
        binding:"Hardcover",
    },
    publisherInfo: {
        publisher:"Tom Doherty Associates",
        publisherCity:"New York"
    },
    physicalInfo: {
        numPages:171,
        height:8.25,
        width:5.25,
        thickness:0.625
    }
}>

<p>The myBook structure contains the basicInfo structure:</p>
<bx:dump var="#myBook.basicInfo#" label="basicInfo">

<p>The myBook structure contains the categoryInfo structure:</p>
<bx:dump var="#myBook.categoryInfo#" label="categoryInfo">

<p>The myBook structure contains the authorInfo structure:</p>
<bx:dump var="#myBook.authorInfo#" label="authorInfo">

<p>The myBook structure contains the publicationInfo structure:</p>
<bx:dump var="#myBook.publicationInfo#" label="publicationInfo">

<p>The myBook structure contains the publisherInfo structure:</p>
<bx:dump var="#myBook.publisherInfo#" label="publisherInfo">

<p>The myBook structure contains the physicalInfo structure:</p>
<bx:dump var="#myBook.physicalInfo#" label="physicalInfo">

<p>The myBook structure:</p>
<bx:dump var="#myBook#" label="myBook">